WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.272
START. Show a ball at rest, then a foot gently kicking it.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.376
STOP. Two hands stop the rolling ball.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.080
TURN. A side push changes the ball direction.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.485
SHAPE. A soft sponge changes shape under gentle squeeze.
